  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/420/241/tiny-pvp-swords-and-tool.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"952\" height=\"62\"></p>\n<p><strong>描述</strong></p>\n<p>製作這個材質包是為了搭配我的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/best-pvp\" rel=\"nofollow\">Best PVP 整合包</a>，並考慮將其作為獨立資源包發布。所有劍在 Photoshop 中已裁切掉 5x5 像素，整體尺寸也隨之縮小。工具的圖標則縮減了 4x4 像素。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>較小的武器與工具能騰出更多螢幕空間，進一步優化原版遊戲體驗，對 PVP 相當實用。所有紋理皆源自原版遊戲，僅將尺寸調小。</p>\n<p>本材質包還內建了 PVP 專用準心。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/420/240/untitled-7.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/457/563/2022-04-26_22.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">今天就租一台伺服器，和朋友一起遊玩吧！點擊 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a> 或下方橫幅，並使用優惠碼 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 即可享有 25% 折扣！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
